### Create a LifeOps plan
POST http://localhost:8000/api/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_input": "I have exams next week, 2 assignments, and a meeting tomorrow",
  "autonomous_mode": false
}

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8000/api/dashboard

### List actions
GET http://localhost:8000/api/actions

### Execute all safe actions
POST http://localhost:8000/api/actions/execute-safe
